## MICROSOFT AUTOGEN PATTERNS

### Agent Configuration Template
```python
def create_agent(role: str, expertise: str) -> AssistantAgent:
    """
    Standard agent creation pattern - customize role and expertise
    
    Common config:
    - model: "gpt-4" (NOT gpt-4o for cost optimization)
    - max_tokens: 500 (control costs)
    - temperature: 0.1 (deterministic responses)
    - timeout: 30, request_timeout: 60
    """
    config_list = [{
        "model": "gpt-4",
        "api_key": os.environ["OPENAI_API_KEY"],
        "max_tokens": 500,
        "temperature": 0.1,
        "timeout": 30,
        "request_timeout": 60
    }]
    
    return AssistantAgent(
        name=role,
        llm_config={"config_list": config_list},
        system_message=expertise,  # Detailed role definition
        human_input_mode="NEVER",  # Automated for POC
        max_consecutive_auto_reply=3,  # Prevent infinite loops
        code_execution_config=False
    )
```

